WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.192
Confirm the household. Choose the existing family. A contact correction is not a reason to create another household.

00:00:12.192 --> 00:00:24.384
Make the verified correction. Change only the approved address. This demonstration uses a synthetic training address.

00:00:24.384 --> 00:00:36.576
Save the correction once. Use Save family and wait for the result. Identity, access and billing are separate actions.

00:00:36.576 --> 00:00:48.768
Reopen the record. Reload and compare the saved address with the intended correction. Do not rely only on a success message.

00:00:48.768 --> 00:01:00.960
Confirm the saved result. The training store contains the corrected family and a saved-operation receipt. No real school record was changed.

